        (uint256 storedUnlockTime, uint256 storedBalance) = c.Acc(caller);

        // The universal property: after a successful Put, the stored unlockTime is >= block.timestamp
        // (reference maintains max(_unlockTime, block.timestamp)). The mutant can set it < block.timestamp.
        // We assert only when the Put call succeeded (reference always succeeds), preserving admissible domain.
